Error [E2421]: public fallible function `load` exposes non-public failure carrier member `PublicFailure.detail`.
  --> tests/ui/e2421_public_failure_carrier.jet:5:5
    |
  5 |     detail: String
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: the public failure contract makes `PublicFailure.detail` part of the callable's visible carrier, but its declaration is not public.
 Fix: make `PublicFailure.detail` public, or keep `load` non-public.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2421

